{"id":"fa_brica","lemma":"fábrica","pos":"noun","rank":1531,"glosses":["factory"],"ipa":"/ˈfabɾika/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"fábricas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-f%C3%A1brica.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él trabaja en una fábrica.","en":"He works in a factory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/49708","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to work","l":"trabajar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Vayamos a la fábrica.","en":"Let's go to the factory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594478","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Han decidido cerrar esta fábrica.","en":"They've decided to shut down this factory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704351","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"decided"},{"g":"to close, to shut"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null]},{"text":"Las fábricas están produciendo en grande.","en":"The factories are producing on a large scale.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to produce","l":"producir"},null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"big time"]]},{"text":"Ayer cerró la fábrica.","en":"The factory closed yesterday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/427820","words":[{"g":"yesterday"},{"g":"to close, to shut","l":"cerrar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}